lnav (FULL_VERSION) stable; urgency=low

  ## lnav v0.14.1

  - New `:reload-view` command (F5) that re-runs whatever populated the
    current view: the last SQL query in the DB view, the index in TIMELINE.
  - The DB view shows the query that populated it, when it ran and how long
    it took, and whether the results are on current or old log data.
  - Kitty keyboard protocol support in the prompt (copy, select all, cut,
    undo), keyboard resizing of the multi-line prompt and more
    readline-style key bindings.
  - The message details panel gains a `File:` row with the source file and
    line; raw JSON log messages can be copied to the clipboard.

  Older entries have been trimmed. The complete upstream changelog lives at
  https://github.com/tstack/lnav/releases
